  "instructions": [
    "Season the pork knuckle with sea salt, black pepper, chili flakes, and dried oregano. ",
    "Wrap the pork knuckle in plastic wrap and seal in a sous vide bag. ",
    "Cook the pork knuckle in a water bath at 130\u0000120F for 24 hours.",
    " Meanwhile, combine parsley, garlic, chimichurri, and salsa criolla in a bowl. ",
    "Sear the sous vide bag of pork knuckle in a hot skillet with olive oil until browned, about 5 minutes per side.",
    "Transfer the pork knuckle to a cutting board and let rest for 10 minutes before slicing.",
    "To assemble the bowl, place a portion of the sliced pork knuckle on the bottom, followed by a spoonful of the parsley mixture, a sprinkle of parmesan cheese, and a few sprigs of fresh cilantro.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
  ],
